Z||000000||loafer87gt||01-03-2001||01:09 AM||||I'm pretty sure that was their name. They did a dance remix of "Radar Love", a tune called "Hit You with my Rythym Stick", and their self titled track "Oh Well". My older bro used to have the CD, and I haven't been able to find one at any used record shop or using Napster. I just wanted to check with you guy to see if I had the name of the band right. Anybody up on their late 80's early 90 dance?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
